        "initialMessages": "Welcome to Spice Court! 🌶️✨\nWe're delighted to serve you. Whether you'd like to place an order, check menu availability, make a reservation, explore our catering services, or learn about our policies, I'm here to help.\n\nHow can I assist you today? 🍽️",
